  "body": "### Summary\nAs ezzz (the App Store publisher) I want a ready set of App Store visuals before the general release, so that the listing can go live with the build. Operator, 2026-11-27: the visuals are to be handed to ezzz before the release. Part of LOT-165 (#255).\n\n### Scope\n1. **Art direction** shared with the new README hero (see the companion issue): caption style, background, type, French captions.\n2. **Screenshot list** (proposal for the operator): forum list, topic reader, composer, private messages, themes, iPhone Duo / large screen, offline reading.\n3. **Sizes** per Apple's current App Store Connect screenshot specifications (cite the official page in the PR; do not guess the pixel sizes), iPhone first, iPad if the listing ships iPad.\n4. **Capture**: real app screenshots on the simulator (Mac), test account only, content invented or anonymized (no real pseudo, avatar or post), status bar cleaned (`xcrun simctl status_bar … override`).\n5. **Composition**: captions and frames rendered from versioned sources (HTML + Playwright), output PNGs in `docs/assets/appstore/`, plus a short handoff note for ezzz.\n\n### Depends on\n- #255 (LOT-165 is on hold: App Store Connect access and the operator's decision, #1134); the art direction and the composition sources can start now.\n\n### Acceptance\n- The operator approved the captions and the screen list; the PNGs meet the official sizes; the set is handed to ezzz (recorded on this issue, link or channel and date only).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
