   "body": "/claim cloud/i1380-fable\n\nPlan (art direction only; the captures and the final set stay with the Mac session):\n- Propose the visual language: the `:o` poster of #1380 (two inks and paper, Inter headline, monospace kicker), not the lens. Operator to confirm.\n- One reusable HTML template that frames a screenshot with a French caption, plus a caption list (proposal for the screens of this issue) and a Playwright render script, in `docs/assets/appstore/source/`.\n- Pixel sizes only from Apple's App Store Connect « Screenshot specifications » page, cited.\n- A sample render with a placeholder slot to show the direction; no fake app screen.\n- Draft PR with `Refs #1381` (what is left: real captures, operator's approval of captions and screens, final PNGs, handoff to ezzz).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
