   "body": "## Art direction: proposal for the operator (draft PR #1384)\n\n![The seven frames with placeholders](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/67778a120e0b92315bc1dd087fd634d873a54e22/docs/assets/appstore/art-direction.jpg?raw=true)\n\n**Which language: B's (`:o` poster), not A's (the lens).** An App Store page is a row of small portrait cards: flat inks and a two-line headline stay readable at that size, a perspective scene does not, and the screenshot already is « the app on a phone ». It also ties the listing to the social preview.\n\n- **Background**: three flat inks in turn, HFR orange, paper, ink.\n- **Caption**: French, two short lines, Inter 900, the second line in the accent colour; a monospace kicker (`01/07 · CATÉGORIES`) and the `:o` signature above a rule.\n- **Screenshot**: the whole capture, never cropped, in a plain dark slab (no island, button, lens or device name).\n- **Template**: `docs/assets/appstore/source/frame.html` + `screens.json` + `render.js`. The hatched slots are placeholders: no fake app screen is drawn.\n\n**Proposed screens and captions** (to approve or change):\n\n| # | Screen | Caption |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Catégories | Tout HFR, / en natif. |\n| 2 | Topic reader | Des topics / enfin lisibles. |\n| 3 | Composer | Répondre, / sans balises. |\n| 4 | Private messages | Vos MP, / sous le pouce. |\n| 5 | Themes | Clair, sombre, / rétro 5250. |\n| 6 | iPhone Duo / large screen | Grand écran, / deux colonnes. |\n| 7 | Offline reading | Le topic / dans le tunnel. |\n\n**Sizes**, from Apple's « Screenshot specifications » (<https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/screenshot-specifications/>, read 2026-11-27): iPhone 1320 × 2868 and 1206 × 2622 (the page's required iPhone row is the medium Dynamic Island display); iPad 13\" 2064 × 2752, « Required if app runs on iPad »; iPhone Duo 1398 × 2034 and 2007 × 2853, required from April 2027 for apps on the iOS 27.1 SDK. **Question for the operator: does the listing ship iPad, and do we provide the Duo set now?**\n\n**For the Mac session**: one PNG per screen and size in `docs/assets/appstore/source/captures/<size id>/<capture>.png` (names in `screens.json`; rules in `docs/assets/appstore/README.md`).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
